[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3821210261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115596#issuecomment-3821210261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115596","id":3821210261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jwwqV","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T01:02:55Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T01:02:55Z","body":"It looks like the issue is when Controls are not visible, their minimum sizes are not updated, not that it updates too late. Specifically the `data.last_minimum_size` isn't updated, which makes the check in `Control::_update_minimum_size()` fail when it is called when visible with children.\r\n\r\nRather than putting it in `Control::get_combined_minimum_size()` which is exposed and could be called from anywhere with side effects, it could just be where it is called in `Control::_update_minimum_size()`, and then there isn't a need for an `updating_size` flag. Like:\r\n```c++\r\nvoid Control::_update_minimum_size() {\r\n\tif (!is_inside_tree()) {\r\n\t\tdata.updating_last_minimum_size = false;\r\n\t\treturn;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tbool was_invalid = !data.minimum_size_valid;\r\n\tSize2 minsize = get_combined_minimum_size();\r\n\tdata.updating_last_minimum_size = false;\r\n\r\n\tif (was_invalid || minsize != data.last_minimum_size) {\r\n```\r\n\r\nOr we could remove the `is_visible_in_tree` check from `Control::update_minimum_size()`. This would also make the `minimum_size_changed` able to emit when not visible.\r\n\r\nAlso looks related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/78009#issuecomment-1584477539","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3821210261/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3821279613","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115596#issuecomment-3821279613","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115596","id":3821279613,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7jxBl9","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T01:28:19Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T01:36:07Z","body":"> It looks like the issue is when Controls are not visible, their minimum sizes are not updated, not that it updates too late. Specifically the data.last_minimum_size isn't updated, which makes the check in Control::_update_minimum_size() fail when it is called when visible with children.\r\n\r\nI see. I assumed it was because of the deferred call because in the MRP, the container _is_ made visible before children are added, but the size cache is only updated after the fact.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3821279613/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837468942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115596#issuecomment-3837468942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115596","id":3837468942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kuyEO","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T21:17:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T21:18:01Z","body":"The `!is_visible_in_tree()` check dates back to 005b69cf6e276209464cc8c36ebc7376679925b6. While I don't know its original purpose, it prevents Controls from updating their size while invisible (which is nice, because their size is irrelevant until they appear). The size is updated when they become visible:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3c5e561024b2aeee7494e675fbed4724dd216fe2/scene/gui/control.cpp#L3974-L3976\r\nSo I guess the problem is that the order of updates is wrong when visibility is propagated. Is there no other way to fix it? If no, or it's not feasible right now, then removing this check is fine. However it might make things a bit slower due to extraneous updates (not sure how much significant impact it may have).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3837468942/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3838743667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115596#issuecomment-3838743667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115596","id":3838743667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kzpRz","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T02:51:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T02:51:29Z","body":"If we are concerned about performance here, it should be possible to move the visibility check to `Control::_update_minimum_size`. The important part is that `data.last_minimum_size` gets updated so the check won't fail when the minimum size changes when being made visible.\r\n\r\nLike:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/scene/gui/control.cpp b/scene/gui/control.cpp\r\nindex 4cc36ec128..ceb7b528a1 100644\r\n--- a/scene/gui/control.cpp\r\n+++ b/scene/gui/control.cpp\r\n@@ -1664,8 +1664,10 @@ void Control::_update_minimum_size() {\r\n \r\n \tif (minsize != data.last_minimum_size) {\r\n \t\tdata.last_minimum_size = minsize;\r\n-\t\t_size_changed();\r\n-\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(minimum_size_changed));\r\n+\t\tif (is_visible_in_tree()) {\r\n+\t\t\t_size_changed();\r\n+\t\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(minimum_size_changed));\r\n+\t\t}\r\n \t}\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\nOr my other suggestion to check `data.minimum_size_valid` here instead should also work.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3838743667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3839289506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115596#issuecomment-3839289506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115596","id":3839289506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7k1uii","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T06:15:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T06:15:30Z","body":"I'm indeed a bit worried about performance for control heavy projects with a lot of hidden controls. Think e.g. tab based interfaces like https://store.steampowered.com/app/3469750/Military_Incremental_Complex/\r\n\r\nOr I guess a quick way to test would be the Godot editor itself, maybe we can measure if there's any significant impact on startup time om a project that would restore many scenes and scripts open in their tabs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3839289506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3841481520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115596#issuecomment-3841481520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115596","id":3841481520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7k-Fsw","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T13:56:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T13:56:14Z","body":"> Or my other suggestion to check `data.minimum_size_valid` here instead should also work.\r\n\r\nI've changed the code to use that implementation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3841481520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3848695995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115596#issuecomment-3848695995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115596","id":3848695995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lZnC7","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T17:12:29Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T17:12:29Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3848695995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]